# Clutter patterns for extracted 3GPP archives and checkout directories.
#
# Syntax: gitignore (https://git-scm.com/docs/gitignore) — '#' comments,
# '!' re-includes, trailing '/' matches directories at any depth.
#
# This file is copied to <cache-dir>/clutter-ignore (e.g.
# ~/.3gpp-crawler/clutter-ignore) on first use and re-created if deleted.
# Edit that copy to extend or narrow the filter — your edits are kept.

# macOS archive metadata
__MACOSX/
._*
.DS_Store

# Windows shell metadata
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Office lock/temp files
~$*
